# Blockchain Visualizer (HubBlock)

## What This Is
An interactive educational web app visualizing blockchain concepts: SHA-256 hashing, avalanche effect, block mining (Proof of Work), blockchain explorer, Merkle trees, P2P network simulation and RSA cryptography. Built with Next.js + shadcn/ui + Tailwind v4. UI defaults to Vietnamese, light theme.

## Tech Stack
- **Framework:** Next.js 16 (App Router, React 19, TypeScript strict)
- **UI:** shadcn/ui (Base UI primitives, Tailwind CSS v4, `cn()` utility)
- **Icons:** Lucide React
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS v4 with oklch design tokens
- **Crypto:** Web Crypto API with synchronous SHA-256 fallback (`src/lib/crypto/`)
- **Local network sim:** 3 full nodes on localhost via `npm run network` (`scripts/p8-network/`)

## Commands
- `npm run dev` — Start dev server
- `npm run build` — Production build
- `npm run lint` — ESLint check
- `npm run typecheck` — TypeScript check
- `npm run check` — Run lint + typecheck + build
- `npm run network` — Start local 3-node P2P cluster (ports 4101–4103) for the Mining → Network tab

## Code Style
- TypeScript strict mode, no `any`
- Named exports, PascalCase components, camelCase utils
- Tailwind utility classes, no inline styles
- 2-space indentation
- Responsive: mobile-first

## Design Principles
- **Education-first** — every visualization must teach the underlying concept (fixed-length output, avalanche effect, one-way property, Proof of Work)
- **Real cryptography** — use real SHA-256 / Web Crypto results, never mock hashes
- **Vietnamese-first content** — new user-facing strings need both `vi` and `en` entries in `src/lib/i18n/dictionary.ts`
- **Sổ cái aesthetic** — ledger/paper visual language defined in `src/app/globals.css`; reuse `.lab-tray`, `.stamp`, `.hash-field` primitives instead of inventing new styles

## Project Structure
```
src/
  app/              # Next.js routes
  components/       # React components
    views/          # App views (Home, HashDemo, Mining, RSA + tabs)
    lab/            # Shared lab UI primitives (LabTray, Stamp, HashField, ...)
    ui/             # shadcn/ui primitives
    app-context.tsx # Global tab + language state (HubProvider, useHub)
  lib/
    crypto/         # SHA-256 + blockchain primitives (Merkle, ECDSA, blocks)
    i18n/           # vi/en content dictionary
    utils.ts        # cn() utility (shadcn)
public/
  images/           # App images
  videos/           # App videos
  seo/              # Favicons, OG images, webmanifest
docs/
  research/         # Research notes
  design-references/ # Screenshots and visual references
scripts/
  p8-network/       # Local P2P node cluster
```

